    "note": "Amended 2024-05-16; the Senate vote (26-9, 2024-05-21) was on this text, and no later floor vote is recorded. This amendment struck the bill's earlier changes to Sections 31610, 31615 (possession of a firearm without a certificate from 2026), 31625, 31640 and 31655, leaving only new Section 31615.1; subd. (b) is the added misdemeanor penalty. The remaining chapter's other sections are untouched."
  },
  "operative_text": "Section 31615.1 (Penal Code): (a) Within 120 days of bringing any firearm, except an antique firearm, into this state, a personal firearm importer shall obtain a firearm safety certificate.\nSection 31615.1 (Penal Code): (b) A violation of this section is punishable as a misdemeanor."
